{#
  Liaison paragraphe `video_centered` -> SDC `drive_matic:video-centered`.
  Miniature = média image responsive 16:9 (slot thumbnail) ; embed = formatter
  video_embed_field (slot video, injecté dans un <template> côté SDC).
#}
{% embed 'drive_matic:video-centered' with {
  caption: paragraph.field_caption.value,
} %}
  {% block thumbnail %}{{ content.field_photo }}{% endblock %}
  {% block video %}{{ content.field_video }}{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
